  ('Push Pull Legs + Arms (Gym)', 'Push, Pull and Legs days with an optional Arms day. For clients with some gym experience.', 'Run Push, Pull, Legs in order. Add the Arms day as a 4th session if you have time. Take at least 1 full rest day each week. RPE 7 means you could have done about 3 more reps. When you hit the top of the rep range on every set, go a little heavier next time.', '[{"name":"Push","exercises":[{"name":"Barbell bench press","sets":3,"reps":"6-8","rpe":7.5,"rest":"2-3 min","tempo":"2-1-1","notes":"Feet planted, slight arch, touch mid-chest","video_url":""},{"name":"Incline dumbbell press","sets":3,"reps":"8-10","rpe":7,"rest":"90s","tempo":"3-0-1","notes":"Bench at about 30 degrees","video_url":""},{"name":"Seated dumbbell shoulder press","sets":3,"reps":"8-10","rpe":7,"rest":"90s","tempo":"2-0-1","notes":"Back against the pad, ribs down","video_url":""},{"name":"Cable lateral raise","sets":3,"reps":"12-15","rpe":8,"rest":"60s","tempo":"2-0-2","notes":"Lead with the elbow, stop at shoulder height","video_url":""},{"name":"Triceps rope pushdown","sets":3,"reps":"10-12","rpe":8,"rest":"60s","tempo":"2-0-1","notes":"Elbows pinned, split the rope at the bottom","video_url":""}]},{"name":"Pull","exercises":[{"name":"Lat pulldown","sets":3,"reps":"8-10","rpe":7.5,"rest":"90s","tempo":"2-1-1","notes":"Pull elbows down to your back pockets","video_url":""},{"name":"Seated cable row","sets":3,"reps":"8-10","rpe":7.5,"rest":"90s","tempo":"2-1-1","notes":"Chest up, squeeze shoulder blades","video_url":""},{"name":"Chest-supported dumbbell row","sets":3,"reps":"10-12","rpe":7,"rest":"90s","tempo":"2-1-1","notes":"Chest on an incline bench","video_url":""},{"name":"Face pull","sets":3,"reps":"12-15","rpe":7,"rest":"60s","tempo":"2-1-1","notes":"Pull to your forehead, thumbs back","video_url":""},{"name":"Dumbbell hammer curl","sets":3,"reps":"10-12","rpe":8,"rest":"60s","tempo":"2-0-2","notes":"No swinging","video_url":""}]},{"name":"Legs","exercises":[{"name"